{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hey! What are you up to?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: I'm working on my business plan.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: How's that going?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Good. By writing a business plan, I'm forcing myself to look at the business from every angle. This plan defines my business, sets goals, creates a plan to generate revenue, lists expenses, describes my customer base, and examines my competition.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sounds like a lot to do on your own.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Well, I'm going to the bank later. I'm meeting with a financial advisor. One of the numbers I'll need to generate is the start-up cost. Anyway, what are you doing today?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'm going to spend the day identifying my skills and interests. I'll have to create a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 too.", "time": "25000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Great idea! Do you want some pointers?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Start creating the largest section of your master r\u00e9sum\u00e9. You can do this by using your old r\u00e9sum\u00e9s. This section can be separated into categories like work or volunteer experience. Then, start listing items within the categories from most recent to oldest. This will make developing a targeted r\u00e9sum\u00e9 quick and easy.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Okay. What about my skills?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: The next step is defining your top 3 - 5 skills and strengths.", "time": "47000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Gotcha.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: After you've taken the time to create the content, spend some time formatting your master r\u00e9sum\u00e9. Having an organized master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 ensures that you won't lose track of important information that could be included on one version of a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 but omitted from others. It is also worthwhile to have someone do some editing and proofreading.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Of course.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Also, keeping your master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 up to date is important. Plan to regularly update it, perhaps once every two months, to make sure you don't forget anything!", "time": "86000", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and career plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss future plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain how to complete a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you know what a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 is? If yes, what is it? if no, what do you think it is?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you have one? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content