, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "What is a Gerund?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A gerund is a noun made from a verb by adding \"-ing\".", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "It is an action verb that is acting as a noun. The noun refers to an activity instead of a person or thing. <span class=\"strong\">Gerunds </span>are written in their -ing form. You can use a gerund as the subject, the complement or the object of your sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"strong\">gerund </span>can function as the subject of a sentence, either on its own or as part of a phrase.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">Writing</span> (a business plan) makes you look at your business from all angles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It can also be the object of your sentence after certain verbs like \u201c<span class=\"italic\">make\u201d. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">makes </span><span class=\"underline\">creating</span> a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 much easier.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Type\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The gerund as the subject of the sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Having a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 is a great help.<br>  Listing items in categories will help you stay organized.<br> Keeping your master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 up to date is important.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The gerund as the complement of the sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The next step is choosing your top 3 skills.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The gerund as the object of the sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I liked doing PR.<br> This makes developing a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 easy.<br> Start listing items here.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Elements of a Master R\u00e9sum\u00e9", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 includes: <br><li>personal information (name, address, phone number, e-mail address) <br><li>your strengths and skills<br><li> current/past volunteer experience <br><li>education<br><li> work experience", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Your strengths and skills can be determined by looking at your volunteer and work experience.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>List your current and past volunteer positions. Be mindful of which of these have helped you develop/showcase your strengths/skills.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "List the formal education courses you have taken, in reverse-chronological order. This r\u00e9sum\u00e9 section usually only contains secondary and formal postsecondary institutions you've attended. If you haven't completed a diploma or degree, list the expected completion date or be clear about how many years you have completed. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "List all previous positions you've held.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<div class=\"center_text\">Your Name \u2022 Street Address \u2022 City, State, Zip \u2022 Telephone number \u2022 E-mail</div><br><span class=\"strong\">Strengths/Skills", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>Strength/Skill #1 <br><li>Strength/Skill #2 <br><li>Strength/Skill #3 <br><li>Strength/Skill #4 <br><li>Strength/Skill #5", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Volunteer Experience</span><br>Organization: <br>Dates: <br>Role/Responsibility:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Education</span> <br>Institution: <br>Dates:<br> Course/Diploma/Degree:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Work Experience </span><br>Company: <br>Dates: <br>Role/Responsibility:", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "business plan ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document which explains what a company wants to do in the future, and how it plans to do it ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm working on my business plan. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you want to open your business.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to define", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to describe as exactly as possible what something is", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This plan defines my business.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "set goals ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the things you decide that you want to achieve ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have set goals in mind?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "generate revenue ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "produce money over a period of time from selling goods or services  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to create a plan to generate revenue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "customer base", "type": "name"}, {"content": "people who buy something from a place again and again", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you describe your customer base?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "financial advisor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a professional who provides advice about managing money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm meeting with a financial advisor this afternoon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "start-up cost ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the initial expenses necessary to start a business  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to generate the start-up cost. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to omit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not include something because it isn't necessary ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some information is included on one version of a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 but omitted from another version. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Look at the format a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 follows on the following page.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using that format and the information provided, create your own master r\u00e9sum\u00e9. If you have no work experience, make up a few examples. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, show it to a friend. Have your friend edit your master r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread his/her master r\u00e9sum\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your master r\u00e9sum\u00e9s and future plans.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I create a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about my work experience. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I proofread a partner's master r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my future plans. ", "type": "text"}]}]}